{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike-sold-via-amazon-2608-0135","content_id":"b2008947-7daf-4e4f-899d-d560228e2984","description":"Product Safety Report for URLIFE T2 Electric Bike presenting a serious risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e83de57d-1a83-47a6-b85b-f07a2e3c6d28","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-15T16:48:02+01:00","id":"e83de57d-1a83-47a6-b85b-f07a2e3c6d28","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:48:02+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa968b2086ce7c57b81850a/2608-0135-product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: URLIFE T2 Electric Bike</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The electric bike and its components have not been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, and the bike was supplied with a non-compliant adaptor.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and the listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/Sports Equipment - Cycles (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>URLIFE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>T2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product code / SKU</td>\n      <td>XOD6337332, T2-BLACK-U, 179/196</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Plug</td>\n      <td>NF-004</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Charger</td>\n      <td>JY-546200</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0H1Q21LGG</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Shenzhen Yiqixing Trading Co., Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Electric bike with wall plug and charger.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e83de57d-1a83-47a6-b85b-f07a2e3c6d28\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa968b2086ce7c57b81850a/2608-0135-product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The electric bike and its components have not been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures.  There is insufficient technical documentation, and a valid Declaration of Conformity was not provided to demonstrate that the e-bike and its lithium-ion battery system had been designed and manufactured in accordance with the applicable safety requirements. In the event of a fault, the battery could overheat, enter thermal runaway and cause a fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product was also supplied with an additional non-compliant two-pin plug which does not conform to BS 1363.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon)</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0135</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-15T15:48:27Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-15","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-15T16:48:27+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike-sold-via-amazon-2608-0135","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike-sold-via-amazon-2608-0135","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike-sold-via-amazon-2608-0135","content_id":"b2008947-7daf-4e4f-899d-d560228e2984","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-15T15:48:27Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: URLIFE T2 Electric Bike sold via Amazon (2608-0135)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-urlife-t2-electric-bike-sold-via-amazon-2608-0135","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name